WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.659
Top N per group is a common CTE plus window pattern
First

00:00:05.685 --> 00:00:11.953
calculate a rank inside each group Then put that
ranked result in a CTE

00:00:13.699 --> 00:00:19.467
Finally filter the rank in the outer query The
separation is useful

00:00:19.493 --> 00:00:23.243
because window functions are computed before the
outer filtering stage
